# HTTP examples for module 20-docker-deployment. Run them from IntelliJ IDEA / VS Code (REST Client).
# Start the lesson first (spring-boot:run) or the container system (docker compose, see README).

### 3.3 Liveness: is the process healthy? (a restart would help if not)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health/liveness

### 3.3 Readiness: may it receive traffic? (includes the database)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health/readiness

### 3.1 The API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### 3.5 Configuration from the environment (host = container ID in Docker)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shop

### 3.4 A slow request: run "docker compose stop app" while it runs — it still finishes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/slow?millis=5000
